  characterName: Kwame Boateng
  promptText: An international lender conditions major climate relief on steep healthcare
    cuts. Accepting unlocks funds for cleaner infrastructure but endangers essential
    clinics; rejecting keeps care for vulnerable people but limits resources for
    green transition.
  leftAnswer: Accepting funds can accelerate climate action that benefits many over
    time.
  rightAnswer: Protecting clinics today preserves lives that cannot be traded for
    loans.
